<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH RPIX CLOSES SHARPLY DOWN.</title>
<headline>CZECH RPIX CLOSES SHARPLY DOWN.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech RPIX index of continuously traded</p>
<p>shares falls at Friday's close.</p>
<p>* RPIX down 32 points to 1,052 </p>
<p>* Turnover, 13.4 million crowns</p>
<p>* CEZ loses 47 crowns to 961</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka off 70 crowns to 2,150</p>
<p>* Chemopetrol down 28 crowns to 1,167</p>
<p>* Ceska Sporitelna declines 13 crowns to 330</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom falls 55 crowns to 2,995</p>
<p>* Komercni IF only index gainer, up three to 663</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
